{"id":2720,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>在中北大学建校85周年来临之际，为加强青年思想引领，传承红色军工基因，5月15日下午，马克思主义学院“知行宣讲团”走进太原市第六十六中学，开展以“传承人民兵工精神，践行青年强国担当”为主题的宣讲活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLz7HbL4AVoRV7Ug8MRM8C8L49ZUNMLVoR-ZLzCZLN7aL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4M1hkU1y8nmMfMl7ZMmQ7M4C4U4N8LzvDnNLbnmWknRrFL7QRL7QRM4AFUml8U1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaL4lJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/136BB4F3A5A866D763C94176FC9F2BD5/0FC0FC78/B54B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"622\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLz7HbL4AVoRV7Ug8MRM8C8L49ZUNMLVoR-ZLzCZLN7aL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4M1hkU1y8nmMfMl7ZMmQ7M4C4U4N8LzvDnNLbnmWknRrFL7QRL7QRM4AFUml8U1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaL4lJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WnlCHDMmLaUz9Zngl-PUz7DMz6kM4GLPLlWRMNr7o7Lanl-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaokhVokyDLzCPnlCsM4lDozCsUmT2M7UDUN-aM4viMRAFLRf2MRUPozVFUmN8okb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaL4lJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/908E86161EF7756967B9F4D6BB077548/00F44191/B948\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"617\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WnlCHDMmLaUz9Zngl-PUz7DMz6kM4GLPLlWRMNr7o7Lanl-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaokhVokyDLzCPnlCsM4lDozCsUmT2M7UDUN-aM4viMRAFLRf2MRUPozVFUmN8okb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaL4lJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次宣讲由宣讲团成员刘洪瑞、李安琪主讲，她们从人民兵工精神的历史起源、核心内涵、新时代传承实践、青年使命担当四个方面展开宣讲，结合中北大学“马背上的学校”红色校史，生动讲述兵工先辈自力更生、艰苦奋斗、开拓进取、无私奉献的峥嵘岁月，深入浅出解读人民兵工精神的丰富内核。同时结合大国重器研发突破、新时代榜样奉献等鲜活案例，立足青年成长实际，引导同学们坚定理想信念、锤炼优良品格、树立报国志向。整场宣讲贴合青年成长实际，把人民兵工精神化作生动讲解，收获师生广泛好评。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WMNCHsolUDozLYMgzrVL7C8MmTknRCLDnlrVLlCYo7MRU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4L1yPMYhRUmLZUzLso7LsozL4MmGDoRNYLz9sUznVoznFU8CiMN7aU46FLllYU49JqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLRLigtA8pUMcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/33217CB38A378C7933606892187A4E94/CF56A0C7/1E2C8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WMNCHsolUDozLYMgzrVL7C8MmTknRCLDnlrVLlCYo7MRU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4L1yPMYhRUmLZUzLso7LsozL4MmGDoRNYLz9sUznVoznFU8CiMN7aU46FLllYU49JqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLRLigtA8pUMcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLz7HbL4AVoRV7Ug8MRM8C8L49ZUNMLVoR-ZLzCZLN7aL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4M1hkU1y8nmMfMl7ZMmQ7M4C4U4N8LzvDnNLbnmWknRrFL7QRL7QRM4AFUml8U1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaL4lJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7035&e=.jpeg"}